      "task_id": "T01",
      "title": "项目任务分布概览",
      "business_question": "各项目的任务数量分布如何？（探索主要分布与差异）",
      "priority": "P0",
      "priority_reason": "删除此任务将无法回答核心需求 C01 '探索主要分布与差异'，因为这是了解数据基本结构的首要步骤。",
      "requirement_ids": [
        "C01"
      ],
      "depends_on": [],
      "missing_inputs": [],
      "steps": [
        {
          "step_id": "S01",
          "operation": "group_aggregate",
          "params": {
            "metrics": [
              {
                "function": "count",
                "field": null,
                "alias": "task_count"
              }
            ],
            "dimensions": [
              "field_0002"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "step_id": "S02",
          "operation": "sort",
          "params": {
            "field": "task_count",
            "direction": "desc"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "task_id": "T02",
      "title": "任务状态分布分析",
      "business_question": "不同状态下的任务数量分布如何？是否存在显著的状态差异？",
      "priority": "P1",
      "priority_reason": "补充性分析，帮助理解业务进展状况，但删除后仍可通过项目维度初步回答分布问题。",
      "requirement_ids": [
        "C01"
      ],
      "depends_on": [],
      "missing_inputs": [],
